  "title": "Illusion of Agency over Electrically-Actuated Movements",
  "description": "This dataset contains electrophysiological recordings investigating the illusion of agency over electrically-actuated movements. The study examines how individuals perceive control and agency when their movements are generated by external electrical stimulation, providing insights into the neural mechanisms underlying sense of agency and motor control.",
